---
// The hero's only decorative flourish — a soft multi-stop bloom built from
// DESIGN.md's develop/preview/ship gradient stops. Nowhere else on the site
// uses color at this intensity; everything else stays ink-on-canvas.
---

<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
	<div
		class="absolute -top-40 left-1/2 h-[560px] w-[900px] -translate-x-1/2 opacity-[0.16] blur-3xl"
		style="background: radial-gradient(closest-side at 20% 30%, #007cf0, transparent),
			radial-gradient(closest-side at 75% 20%, #7928ca, transparent),
			radial-gradient(closest-side at 55% 70%, #50e3c2, transparent),
			radial-gradient(closest-side at 90% 80%, #ff4d4d, transparent);"
	>
	</div>
</div>
